  "tandemSoGehts": [
    "Cut the cards in the middle. Partner A takes the left half, Partner B the right half.",
    "A builds question 1 from the tiles and asks it: “¿Qué hiciste el fin de semana?” The verb tile is the infinitive: you choose the form.",
    "B hears the question and builds the answer. Some verbs are regular (comer, comió), others are irregular and must be learnt: hacer, hice, hizo; tener, tuve; decir, dijo. With the tile ha, the blue verb becomes a participle: escribir, escrito. A tile in brackets, like (yo), says who; it is not written.",
    "Then B asks question 2 and A answers. Take turns. At the end, check with the answer sheet.",
    "Finally: swap cards and do it all again, faster."
  ],
